WEBVTT

00:00:00.175 --> 00:00:04.686
Not printing? Drawer won't open? Check <b>Periféricos</b> (peripherals)

00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:08.391
It's in your account menu

00:00:08.514 --> 00:00:12.065
It tells you whether MiCaja sees the printer and the scale

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.222
From here you run a test without having to sell anything
